├── Payment Schedule
└── Statement Generation

InvestmentService
├── Portfolio Management
├── Trading
├── Performance Analysis
└── Recommendations

NotificationService (Cross-cutting)
├── Email Notifications
├── SMS Alerts
└── Push Notifications
